{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["Community library members renew access cards at the main desk each spring.","Members may reserve the quiet study room for two-hour blocks.","After-hours entry requires a current access card and the west door code.","community library access: the library garden volunteers meet on the first Saturday.","community library access: the story hour cart keeps picture books in blue bins.","community library access: the local history shelf receives a weekly newspaper.","community library access: the printer room posts an unrelated paper limit.","community library access: the makerspace stores spare solder in a locked drawer.","community library access: the reading lamps use a separate replacement schedule.","community library access: the community room has another reservation calendar.","community library access: the book drop is emptied before the morning opening.","community library access: the volunteer desk maintains a different contact list.","community library access: the children room displays an unrelated craft schedule.","community library access: the archive cabinet contains a separate donor index.","community library access: the cafe kiosk closes for an unrelated cleaning cycle.","community library access: the public computers use a different session timeout."],"truncate":false}